1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,473
You have a fixed way of thinking.

2
00:00:04,473 --> 00:00:07,033
Me? I think you do.

3
00:00:07,033 --> 00:00:09,913
Right… you think I am doing that.

4
00:00:09,913 --> 00:00:14,073
When some thoughts come out of me,

5
00:00:14,073 --> 00:00:16,553
it does not mean that is what I
think.

6
00:00:16,553 --> 00:00:18,273
That is fine.

7
00:00:18,297 --> 00:00:21,997
You are too fast.

8
00:00:21,997 --> 00:00:25,717
You get ahead of the words I am
saying.

9
00:00:26,857 --> 00:00:31,597
Maybe I have only said 5% of it,

10
00:00:32,117 --> 00:00:34,297
You’ve filled in the other 95%.

11
00:00:34,837 --> 00:00:37,057
Like ChatGPT.

12
00:00:37,057 --> 00:00:38,937
I say, for example, ten words,

13
00:00:39,237 --> 00:00:41,617
and you have already imagined

14
00:00:41,617 --> 00:00:44,077
the next seventy or eighty lines.

15
00:00:44,077 --> 00:00:44,711
A problem.

16
00:00:44,711 --> 00:00:47,031
Speaking is a slow process.

17
00:00:48,711 --> 00:00:51,271
When you speak very slowly,

18
00:00:51,271 --> 00:00:53,271
what you are saying must be new.

19
00:00:53,271 --> 00:00:55,111
Let me respond to that.

20
00:00:55,111 --> 00:00:58,271
You can say my approach disrupted
our conversation,

21
00:00:58,271 --> 00:00:59,711
or what you needed from it.

22
00:00:59,711 --> 00:01:00,471
The method.

23
00:01:00,471 --> 00:01:02,311
You can tell me: do not speak yet.

24
00:01:02,311 --> 00:01:04,671
I’ll wait until you ask me to
speak.

25
00:01:04,671 --> 00:01:07,191
But do not dismiss my method

26
00:01:07,191 --> 00:01:08,669
as unoriginal just because I am
fast.

27
00:01:08,669 --> 00:01:09,856
AI is fast,

28
00:01:09,856 --> 00:01:11,256
It can still be original.

29
00:01:11,816 --> 00:01:12,907
There is your character.

30
00:01:14,216 --> 00:01:16,496
You assume fast means unoriginal.

31
00:01:16,496 --> 00:01:17,496
What is emergence?

32
00:01:17,896 --> 00:01:19,136
Give us some. Right?

33
00:01:19,136 --> 00:01:20,176
What is emergence?

34
00:01:20,176 --> 00:01:21,136
Start now.

35
00:01:21,136 --> 00:01:22,416
I am not performing for you.

36
00:01:22,416 --> 00:01:25,496
[Overlapping speech]

37
00:01:25,736 --> 00:01:26,872
Isn’t this a performance?

38
00:01:28,216 --> 00:01:29,576
You keep mixing things up.
